{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-01-10 10:15:00', 'title': 'KROGER CELEBRATES 10 YEARS OF SIMPLE TRUTH®', 'text': 'AMERICA\'S #1 ORGANIC AND FREE FROM BRAND REACHES 10-YEAR MILESTONE, CREDITING SUCCESS TO ACCESSIBILITY AND SIMPLE INGREDIENTS CINCINNATI , JAN. 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA\'S GROCER, TODAY SHARED ITS $3+ BILLION SIMPLE TRUTH® BRAND IS MARKING ITS TENTH ANNIVERSARY, CELEBRATING A DECADE OF OFFERING CUSTOMERS AFFORDABLE AND UNIQUE FOODS MADE WITH SIMPLE INGREDIENTS. "A DECADE AGO, SIMPLE TRUTH WAS BORN WHEN WE IDENTIFIED THAT OUR CUSTOMERS WANTED A SIMPLER WAY TO SHOP FOR FREE FROM AND ORGANIC PRODUCTS," SAID JUAN DE PAOLI, VICE PRESIDENT OF OUR BRANDS.'}